        <mxCell id="boundary" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#18333e;strokeColor=#4d7682;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;" value="Inside: [work inside boundary]The Inspection Report Routing System&#39;s inner work include everything that happens &lt;i&gt;after &lt;/i&gt;the Field team supplies an inspection report and &lt;i&gt;up to the moment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;a final validated and accepted report is delivered to its resolved department as a work item.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Outside: Field Team does the work in conducting the inspection&#39;s that generate a report, but is itself outside of the Inspection Report Routing System.&amp;nbsp; Flight control, physical inspections,&amp;nbsp; and table maintenance for the Routing table are recipients of information exported from the system but are not part of the Inspection Report Routing System&#39;s inner workings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sources: [IDs]W06-S01" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="1089" x="40" y="655" as="geometry" />
