        <mxCell id="finding" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#18333e;strokeColor=#4d7682;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;Finding:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Three of the accepted reports (CJ-603, CJ-604, and CJ-607) were received by the wrong destination [W06-S02, W06-S04]. All three mentioned reports were a BRIDGE asset type which according W06-S03 are supposed to be routed to the Structures department; they instead were routed to the Electrical Department [W06-S04].&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unanswered question:&lt;/b&gt; What was the technical cause of the discrepancy between the three misrouted reports in W06-04 and the expected route outlined in W06-S03." vertex="1">
